napdragon® 6s Gen 4 Mobile Platform\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 4nm manufacturing process technology\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; CPU: Octa-core processor, up to 2.4GHz\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; GPU: Adreno\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; LPDDR4X + UFS3.1 (256GB/512GB) / UFS2.2 (128GB)²⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 6GB + 128GB, 6GB + 256GB, 8GB + 256GB, 8GB + 512GB, 12GB + 256GB\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Powered by Xiaomi HyperOS 3³¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Snapdragon® 6 Gen 5 Mobile Platform\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 4nm manufacturing process technology\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; CPU: Octa-core processor, up to 2.6GHz\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; GPU: Adreno\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; LPDDR5X, up to 6400Mbps²⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; UFS 4.1 (256GB/512GB); Sequential read/write speeds: up to 2100 MB/s\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; UFS 2.2 (128GB); Sequential read/write speeds: up to 1000 MB/s\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 8GB + 128GB, 8GB + 256GB, 8GB + 512GB, 12GB + 256GB\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Powered by Xiaomi HyperOS 3³¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"111\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"385\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 8340mAh (typ) Silicon-Carbon Battery²\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 67W HyperCharge¹⁰\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 22.5W reverse charging¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 10000mAh (typ) / 9210mAh (typ) Silicon-Carbon Battery²\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 100W HyperCharge¹⁰\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 27W reverse charging¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"111\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"385\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Dual speakers\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 300% volume boost¹⁹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Dolby Atmos® | Hi-Res\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Dual speakers\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; 400% volume boost¹⁹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Dolby Atmos® | Hi-Res\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"111\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eConnectivity\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"385\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Wi-Fi Protocol: 802.11a/b/g/n/ac³²\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Dual SIM (nano SIM + nano SIM or nano SIM + eSIM)³³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Supports NFC³⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Bluetooth® 5.1\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Wi-Fi 6 capability³⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Dual SIM (nano SIM + nano SIM or nano SIM + eSIM or eSIM + eSIM)³³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Supports NFC³⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; Bluetooth® 6.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"111\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eSecurity\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"385\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; In-screen fingerprint sensor\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; AI face unlock\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; In-screen fingerprint sensor\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; AI face unlock\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ Based on Xiaomi internal data as of May 31, 2026.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e² All battery capacities for the REDMI Note 17 Series are typical capacity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ The data is based on test results from Xiaomi Internal Labs, measured under a simulated, comprehensive battery life scenario reflecting moderate daily use. Over 80% of the battery's capacity is retained after 1600 complete charge cycles, which corresponds to over 6 years of usage. Actual results may vary depending on testing conditions and usage habits.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ 6-year like-new software experience tested with a dedicated software aging test which benchmarks the software experience against when the device is new. Results obtained from Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual situation may vary depending on the network environment, usage scenarios, personal habits and other factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, 200% volume boost refers to 16 levels of volume compared to 15 levels, and actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ The product has passed TÜV SÜD 5-star Titan Quality Certification, Certificate No.: Z2GCN 099551.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ The product has passed TÜV SÜD 5-star Titan Quality Certification, Certificate No.: Z2GCN 099551 0768、Z2GCN 099551 0769、Z2GCN 099551 0767、Z2GCN 099551 0770、Z2GCN 099551 0771.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ The product has passed TÜV SÜD 5-star Battery Performance Certification, Certificate No.: Z2GCN 099551 0763、Z2GCN 099551 0764、Z2GCN 099551 0765、Z2GCN 099551 0766.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ Battery life and charging data are based on tests conducted by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Battery life was measured under a simulated comprehensive scenario reflecting moderate daily use, including home screen use, music playback, social media, email, maps, video streaming, standby, and other typical smartphone activities. Charging was tested in Boost Mode using the in-box 100W charger at 25°C, with the screen off. Actual results may vary depending on the testing environment, software version, network conditions, charging conditions, and individual usage patterns.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰ Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ Supports up to 27W (REDMI Note 17 Pro Max 5G) or 22.5W (REDMI Note 17 Pro 5G, REDMI Note 17 5G and REDMI Note 17) wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through Xiaomi Internal Labs testing. Actual performance may vary depending on battery conditions and other factors. When using this feature, please ensure your phone has sufficient battery and verify the compatibility of the receiving device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² The device is certified to be water and dust resistant exclusively under specific laboratory conditions not corresponding to normal use conditions. The warranty does not cover liquid damage caused by conditions other than test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate due to wear and tear, physical damage and/or disassembly needed for repair. For more information, please see Xiaomi's official website.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³ The product has obtained the TÜV SÜD 5-star Water Resistance Certification. Under IPX8 test conditions, it passed a 2-meter, 72-hour water immersion test. This product is not a professional waterproof device. Its water and dust resistance is not permanent, and protective performance may degrade over time due to daily wear and tear. Do not charge the device while it is wet. Damage caused by liquid immersion is not covered under the warranty.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁴ Feature available via OTA. Underwater Mode is a camera feature and does not extend the device's water resistance. Limited to static freshwater use at a maximum depth of 2m for up to 30 minutes. Not for professional diving, seawater, pool, or hot water. A professional waterproof case is strongly recommended. Liquid damage caused beyond test conditions is not covered by warranty.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁵ The product has obtained SGS 5-star Premium Performance Certification, indicating that it meets the SGS technical standards for drop resistance, bending resistance, and crush resistance. As a precision electronic product, there is still a risk of damage if the phone falls. Please be careful to avoid drops or collisions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁶ The 3-meter drop resistance data is certified by SGS. The phone can withstand a drop from a height of 3 meters onto a smooth granite surface under SGS-standard testing conditions. Actual results may vary. As a precision electronic device, the phone is still at risk of damage if dropped. Please be careful to avoid drops and collisions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁷ Photochromic back panel is exclusive to Cloud Blush variant.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁸ 3200Hz instantaneous touch sampling rate needs to be activated in Game Turbo mode.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁹ Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs; volume boost refers to 17 levels of volume compared to 15 levels, and actual effects may vary due to software and scenarios; please refer to actual use.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁰ 24GB RAM with Memory extension is based on 12GB RAM version. Additional RAM will occupy a corresponding amount of ROM storage. Memory extension is only available when there is enough storage space on your device. Actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models. Configurations available may differ between different regions. Available RAM and storage are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²¹ Availability of AI features may vary based on region. Please check the official website for more information.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²² Google and Gemini are trademarks of Google LLC. Check responses. Setup required. Compatibility and availability vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²³ Available on select devices and internet connection required. Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Results may vary depending on visual matches. Google is a trademark of Google LLC.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁴ Some of the AI Creativity Assistant features require an internet connection and may vary by system software and Gallery Editor app versions. Please refer to actual use experience.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁵ Color availability may vary between markets.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁶ Configurations available may differ between different regions. Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to the storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁷ Available only to users who have never subscribed to a paid Google One plan. 200GB Standard Plan. Post trial auto-renews at monthly standard price unless canceled. Terms: \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/support/terms/google-one-terms/\"\u003e\u003cem\u003ehttps://www.mi.com/global/support/terms/google-one-terms/\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁸ New users only (no prior trials of YouTube Premium, YouTube Music Premium, or YouTube Premium Lite). Post trial auto-renews at monthly standard price unless canceled. Terms: \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com/global/support/terms/youtube-premium-terms\"\u003e\u003cem\u003ehttps://mi.com/global/support/terms/youtube-premium-terms\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e²⁹ Available only to users who have never subscribed to Spotify Premium. Terms apply: \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/support/terms/spotify-premium-terms/\"\u003e\u003cem\u003ehttps://www.mi.com/global/support/terms/spotify-premium-terms/\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁰ Data regarding dimensions and weight tested in Xiaomi Internal Labs; actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³¹ Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS features, apps and services may vary depending on software version and phone model.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³² Connectivity and network bands may vary based on region availability and local operator support.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³³ Use of eSIM requires a wireless service plan. This service plan may be subject to certain restrictions of use on switching service providers and roaming (even after contract expiration). eSIM availability may vary depending on country/region and carrier. For more details, please contact your carrier for more information.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁴ NFC availability may vary between markets.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁵ Feature available via OTA.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³⁶ Wi-Fi 6 capability may vary based on regional availability and local network support. Wi-Fi connectivity (including Wi-Fi frequency bands, Wi-Fi standards, and other features as ratified in IEEE Standard 802.11 specifications) may vary based on regional availability and local network support. The function may be added via OTA when and where applicable.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones, smart hardware, and smart electric vehicles connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In June 2026, the MAU reached 766.5 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of June 30, 2026, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops, and tablets) reached 1,160.8 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. The Company has rapidly emerged as a leading innovator in the smart electric vehicle industry, reaching profitability within six quarters of commencing deliveries and delivering over 600,000 units by February 2026. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2026, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the eighth year in a row, ranking 232nd.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"206","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1787828412"},"common":null}